{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"九年春，齊人殺無知。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"公及齊大夫盟于蔇。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"夏，公伐齊，納子糾。齊小白入于齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"秋七月丁酉，葬齊襄公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"八月庚申，及齊師戰于乾時，我師敗績。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"九月，齊人取子糾殺之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"冬，浚洙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"九年春，雍廩殺無知。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"公及齊大夫盟于蔇，齊無君也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"夏，公伐齊，納子糾。桓公自莒先入。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"秋，師及齊師戰于乾時，我師敗績，公喪戎路，傳乘而歸。秦子、梁子以公旗辟于下道，是以皆止。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_38_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_38","textTraditional":"鮑叔帥師來言曰：「子糾，親也，請君討之。管、召，讎也，請受而甘心焉。」乃殺子糾于生竇，召忽死之。管仲請囚，鮑叔受之，及堂阜而稅之。歸而以告曰：「管夷吾治於高傒，使相可也。」公從之。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}